{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/9bfc3fc87c3c40ea8c8b8b31bcef921b"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/e1c469b52a8d447482593342dc0680b4"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/92af31c8fa2244f3917126f4a76b0823"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/9bfc3fc87c3c40ea8c8b8b31bcef921b","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/e1c469b52a8d447482593342dc0680b4","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/92af31c8fa2244f3917126f4a76b0823","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Asphalt Verification and Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
