    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/14540a51941b4f229fe4cc3a22846331","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/14540a51941b4f229fe4cc3a22846331","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Roadlab, “Test It” a discipline built through consistency, accountability, and pride in doing the work properly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFew journeys reflect this more clearly than that of East London Branch Manager Lwazi Nomyayi, who has recently achieved \u003cstrong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"634\"\u003efull Technical Signatory status for the East London Laboratory\u003c/strong\u003e — a milestone that allows him to sign off on the lab’s complete testing scope.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/hgpjedqa/lwazi-in-east-london.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLwazi joined Roadlab on 1 July 2021 on the N1 Maholisi project as a Senior Materials Tester.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecialising in BSM, soil, and asphalt testing, his attention to detail and respect for correct testing procedures set him apart led to his promotion to Laboratory Supervisor, where he took responsibility for reviewing raw data, ensuring accuracy before submission, and training technicians to apply test methods consistently and correctly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/tfanarkn/lwazi-csp.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollowing Maholisi, Lwazi moved to the Redstone Solar Project between Uniondale and Postmasburg — one of the largest solar developments in Southern Africa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Here, his technical capability and leadership were again recognised, earning him promotion to Assistant Branch Manager, along with responsibility for data capturing and quality oversight. Under his leadership, the team reinforced confidence in Roadlab on this signature project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/awpmcv05/east-london-team.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn July 2023, Lwazi transferred to the East London Branch, continuing as Assistant Branch Manager.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince then, he has pushed himself technically, deepened his understanding of standards and procedures, and worked deliberately toward achieving Technical Signatory status — a reflection of disciplined testing, strong systems, and committed leadership.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab’s Rock Mechanics Laboratory has entered operational readiness and is now focused on verification testing to ensure reliable results once we go to market.</p>",
  "blocks": {
